      "description": "Institut for Samfund og Politik søger et antal faste studielektorer til socialrådgiveruddannelsen - Aalborg University You control your data We and our partners use technologies, including cookies, to collect information about you for various purposes, including necessary, functional, statistical, and marketing purposes. By clicking 'Accept All' you consent to all these purposes. You can also choose the specific purposes you want to consent to by selecting the relevant check boxes and then pressing ‘Save Settings’. You can always withdraw your consent by pressing the small cookie icon in the lower left corner of the page and change your consent. You can read more about our use of cookies and other technologies, as well as our collection and processing of personal data, by clicking the links below: Aalborg University's Privacy Policy Google privacy policy opens in new tab Read more about cookies Show details about the categories Hide details about the categories Necessary Strictly necessary cookies help make a website navigable by enabling basic functions such as page navigation and access to secure areas of the website. Without these cookies, the website cannot function optimally. Service: Cookie Information Purpose: Supports the website's technical functions. Privacy policy: Cookie Information -  Privacy policy Expiry: a year Name: CookieInformationConsent Vendor: www.ak.aau.dk Service: BIG-IP, F5 Purpose: Supports the website's technical functions. Privacy policy: BIG-IP, F5 -  Privacy policy Expiry: a year Name: TS[0-9] Vendor: .ak.aau.dk Service: BIG-IP, F5 Purpose: Supports the website's technical functions. Privacy policy: BIG-IP, F5 -  Privacy policy Expiry: a year Name: TS[0-9] Vendor: .www.ak.aau.dk Service: BIG-IP, F5 Purpose: Supports the website's technical functions. Privacy policy: BIG-IP, F5 -  Privacy policy Expiry: a year Name: TS[0-9] Vendor: www.ak.aau.dk Service: Purpose: Ensures the website and application security. Expiry: